OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright  
OL,6,Fspells and a few showers on Sunday.    
OL,7,FMild and windy with rain at times on   
OL,8,FMonday. Mainly dry and bright on       
OL,9,FTuesday.                               
